        <h2 class="display-lg" id="problem-h">Your front desk is stretched thin.</h2>
        <p class="body-lg muted">Most clinics don't lose patients because of their dentistry. They lose them in the gaps between a phone call, a reminder and a recall.</p>
        <div class="problem-close">
          <p>Each gap looks small on its own. Together they cost you chair time and patients every week.</p>
